BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:othonoi-othonoi-panigiri-of-the-dormition-othonoi-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270815
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270816
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Dormition\, Othonoi
LOCATION:Othonoi\, Othonoi\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:15 August is the one night of the year Othonoi is full: emigrants back from America and Corfu\, liturgy in the morning\, and a panigiri with music and food by the harbour that goes late. Rooms are few\, so book months ahead or come on the day-boat from Agios Stefanos and go back on the late run.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/othonoi/#othonoi-panigiri-of-the-dormition-othonoi
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/othonoi/#othonoi-panigiri-of-the-dormition-othonoi
END:VEVENT
